  "ingredients": [
    "8 (8 ounce) fillets catfish",
    "0.25 cup olive oil",
    "1 tablespoon seasoned pepper",
    "1 tablespoon garlic powder with parsley",
    "1 tablespoon spicy seasoned salt"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather ingredients. Position a rack 5 inches below the heating element of an oven and preheat the broiler to high.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/T96FXPU6LRGsMEe98TxWpRrpWII=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8388158-creole-broiled-catfish-VAT-step-01-6f8ffca80e1144549196c3c4814bc374.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8388158/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rinse the fish fillets under cold running water and pat them dry. Brush both sides with oil and arrange them in a single layer on a broiler pan lined with aluminum foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6SmDcOr-D47SWiafPazlhuZD_sw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8388158-creole-broiled-catfish-VAT-step-02-a75e8bd097ae470da925ba4bf2b8583b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8388158/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix together the seasoned pepper, garlic powder, and seasoned salt in a small bowl. Sprinkle half of the spice mixture over one side of the fish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9LpSLzT5qDBTkDlfM76GF8E_9W8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8388158-creole-broiled-catfish-VAT-step-03-9d66d6854d4c4afdaa4216ebbec0b277.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8388158/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Broil for 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IPai34Dduxk5zdfD62tZ4avLcuU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8388158-creole-broiled-catfish-VAT-step-04-7aa2df3198914976b0e8749ac8dd9029.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8388158/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using a spatula, carefully turn the fish over. Sprinkle with the remaining spice mixture. Continue broiling until the fish is opaque in the center, 3 to 5 minutes more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/q5c7UF_8NsLosK-rLeknznG35eg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8388158-creole-broiled-catfish-VAT-step-05-3939e5373e0043ee8dd73bad667b0cd1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8388158/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve immediately.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Fx5gY4pSDwFz2kE623tjwbh1Bek=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8388158-creole-broiled-catfish-VAT-step-06-b-e11e410a934142a2a09a914f974a8c19.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8388158/step_06.webp"
    }
